//! Discoverable controls shown by ? and :help.

pub(super) const HELP: &str = "COMPOSE · reply-first is on by default\n  Up / Down      save reply and switch messages\n  Left / Right   switch source and restore its reply\n  Alt+arrows     move within reply text\n  i / r          enter insert mode\n  Enter          newline (never sends)\n  Ctrl+Enter     mock send; Alt+Enter / F5 fallback\n  Esc            leave insert mode, keep draft\n  Ctrl+A         attach harmless fixture\n  Ctrl+E         dismiss without replying (whole chat stack)\n  Delete         dismiss and mark read (before typing a reply)\n  PageUp / Down  scroll the preview\n\nBROWSE · navigation mode\n  j / k, arrows  select communication\n  gg / G         first / last message\n  Ctrl+d / u     move down / up a page\n  mouse wheel    scroll without selecting\n  Left / Right   cycle source filter (All, iCloud, Discord, Teams, Email, Office 365)\n  f              cycle focus profile\n  /              search feed\n  a / x          add / remove last fixture attachment\n  s              save draft and switch to selected\n  e / D          dismiss or restore / include dismissed\n  Delete         dismiss and mark read\n  PageUp / Down  scroll the preview\n  u              toggle unread (local until provider connected)\n  S              include spam matches\n  v              open official Discord app\n  d              discard draft with confirmation\n  o / Ctrl+o     full preview; Ctrl+o tries Ghostty\n  n              simulate an incoming message\n  F6             simulate drawer active / inactive\n  F7             next mock outcome: success / failure / uncertain\n  :              command palette (Tab cycles commands)\n  ,              settings (Esc back, Tab section)\n  t              change palette\n  ?              this help\n  q / Ctrl+q     save and quit\n\nREADER\n  j / k, arrows, PageUp / Down  scroll\n  /                           search; Enter jumps next\n  q / Esc                     close reader only\n\nCOMMANDS\n  attach · remove · incoming · follow · save-switch\n  discard · send · fail · uncertain · reconcile · settings\n  focus all|work|personal · theme midnight|dusk\n  source all|discord|teams|email|icloud|office365\n  profile add|remove ID · profile prompt ID\n  accounts · account add [PROVIDER [ID]]\n  account rename ID NAME · account remove ID\n  account enable|disable ID\n  auth ACCOUNT|ai · spam prompt\n  update · motion · preview · help · quit\n\nLIVE SERVICE\n  F5 / Ctrl+Enter replies through the configured account.\n  accounts.ID.enabled and allow_send must be enabled.\n  :connections shows provider status.\n  Uncertain sends: check the original client, then use\n  :resolve accepted or :resolve not-sent (unlocks retry).\n  Attachments are listed for reference; downloads/uploads pending.\n\nDemo messages and sends are fictional. Notification capture is read-only.\nDiscord history/remote read sync, images and the Omarchy plugin remain pending.";
